msgstr ""
".bmp の MIME 型が ``'image/x-ms-bmp'`` から ``'image/bmp'`` に変更されまし"
"た。\n"
"(Contributed by Nitish Chandra in :issue:`22589`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.7.rst:1134
msgid "msilib"
msgstr "msilib"

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`!Database.Close` method can be used to close the :abbr:`MSI` "
"database. (Contributed by Berker Peksag in :issue:`20486`.)"
msgstr ""
"新しい :meth:`!Database.Close` メソッドで :abbr:`MSI` データベースを閉じられ"
"ます。\n"
"(Contributed by Berker Peksag in :issue:`20486`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.7.rst:1142
msgid "multiprocessing"
msgstr "multiprocessing"

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`Process.close() <multiprocessing.Process.close>` method "
"explicitly closes the process object and releases all resources associated "
"with it.  :exc:`ValueError` is raised if the underlying process is still "
"running. (Contributed by Antoine Pitrou in :issue:`30596`.)"
msgstr ""
"新しい :meth:`Process.close() <multiprocessing.Process.close>` メソッドは、プ"
"ロセスオブジェクトを明示的に閉じ、関連するすべてのリソースを解放します。\n"
"対象のプロセスがまだ実行中の場合は :exc:`ValueError` を送出します。\n"
"(Contributed by Antoine Pitrou in :issue:`30596`.)"

msgid ""
"The new :meth:`Process.kill() <multiprocessing.Process.kill>` method can be "
"used to terminate the process using the :data:`~signal.SIGKILL` signal on "
"Unix. (Contributed by Vitor Pereira in :issue:`30794`.)"
msgstr ""
"新しい :meth:`Process.kill() <multiprocessing.Process.kill>` メソッドで、"
"Unix では :data:`~signal.SIGKILL` シグナルを使ってプロセスを終了できます。\n"
"(Contributed by Vitor Pereira in :issue:`30794`.)"

msgid ""
"Non-daemonic threads created by :class:`~multiprocessing.Process` are now "
"joined on process exit. (Contributed by Antoine Pitrou in :issue:`18966`.)"
msgstr ""
":class:`~multiprocessing.Process` が作成した非デーモンスレッドは、プロセス終"
"了時に join されるようになりました。\n"
"(Contributed by Antoine Pitrou in :issue:`18966`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.7.rst:1160
msgid "os"
msgstr "os"

msgid ""
":func:`os.fwalk` now accepts the *path* argument as :class:`bytes`. "
"(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :issue:`28682`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`os.fwalk` の *path* 引数に :class:`bytes` を渡せるようになりました。\n"
"(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :issue:`28682`.)"

msgid ""
":func:`os.scandir` gained support for :ref:`file descriptors <path_fd>`. "
"(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :issue:`25996`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`os.scandir` が :ref:`ファイル記述子 <path_fd>` に対応しました。\n"
"(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :issue:`25996`.)"

msgid ""
"The new :func:`~os.register_at_fork` function allows registering Python "
"callbacks to be executed at process fork. (Contributed by Antoine Pitrou in :"
"issue:`16500`.)"
msgstr ""
"新しい :func:`~os.register_at_fork` 関数で、プロセスの fork 時に実行する "
"Python コールバックを登録できます。\n"
"(Contributed by Antoine Pitrou in :issue:`16500`.)"

msgid ""
"Added :func:`os.preadv` (combine the functionality of :func:`os.readv` and :"
"func:`os.pread`) and :func:`os.pwritev` functions (combine the functionality "
"of :func:`os.writev` and :func:`os.pwrite`). (Contributed by Pablo Galindo "
"in :issue:`31368`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`os.preadv` (:func:`os.readv` と :func:`os.pread` の機能を組み合わせた"
"もの) と :func:`os.pwritev` (:func:`os.writev` と :func:`os.pwrite` の機能を"
"組み合わせたもの) が追加されました。\n"
"(Contributed by Pablo Galindo in :issue:`31368`.)"

msgid ""
"The mode argument of :func:`os.makedirs` no longer affects the file "
"permission bits of newly created intermediate-level directories. "
"(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :issue:`19930`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`os.makedirs` の ``mode`` 引数は、新しく作成される中間ディレクトリのア"
"クセス権ビットに影響しなくなりました。\n"
"(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :issue:`19930`.)"

msgid ""
":func:`os.dup2` now returns the new file descriptor.  Previously, ``None`` "
"was always returned. (Contributed by Benjamin Peterson in :issue:`32441`.)"
msgstr ""
":func:`os.dup2` は新しいファイル記述子を返すようになりました。\n"
"以前は常に ``None`` を返していました。\n"
"(Contributed by Benjamin Peterson in :issue:`32441`.)"

msgid ""
"The structure returned by :func:`os.stat` now contains the :attr:`~os."
"stat_result.st_fstype` attribute on Solaris and its derivatives. "
"(Contributed by Jesús Cea Avión in :issue:`32659`.)"
msgstr ""
"Solaris とその派生 OS では、:func:`os.stat` が返す構造体に :attr:`~os."
"stat_result.st_fstype` 属性が含まれるようになりました。\n"
"(Contributed by Jesús Cea Avión in :issue:`32659`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.7.rst:1191
msgid "pathlib"
msgstr "pathlib"

